E for consistency\",\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"priority\": \"medium\"\n  }\n]","metadata":{"todos":[{"content":"Inspect environment (python/node versions, npm cache, Tailwind availability)","status":"completed","priority":"high"},{"content":"Implement Flask backend: DB schema, auth/tokens, admin sync, link CRUD, redirect, admin moderation, static serving","status":"in_progress","priority":"high"},{"content":"Set up Tailwind + Vite frontend config and dependencies","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Implement React frontend: auth, shorten form, recent links w/ paging & delete, admin moderation","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Verify backend API with a local test run (curl/python), build frontend, run lint/typecheck if available","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Review Dockerfile/README for consistency","status":"pending","priority":"medium"}],"truncated":false},"title":"5 todos","time":{"start":1794382889743,"end":1794382889749}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c98e0304001A1aZqcrTBzM2nP","sessionID":"ses_e367638caffewcXcusTiMoC75h","messageID":"msg_1c98c5f01001p6oNAJOsz4KPnu"}}
