{"type":"text","timestamp":1794383246155,"sessionID":"ses_e367638caffewcXcusTiMoC75h","part":{"id":"prt_1c9937321001fbjGsTVWVi80L6","messageID":"msg_1c9935b39001A7IhMfHxGvYqVl","sessionID":"ses_e367638caffewcXcusTiMoC75h","type":"text","text":"Everything works. Note the frontend uses client-side state, no routing — SPA deep links fall back to index.html correctly. Since we don't actually have client-side routes, that's acceptable (spec says `/r/{code}` takes precedence over frontend's own routes, which it does).\n\nLet me now run a real end-to-end test with gunicorn (the actual production server) to confirm it works, including restart persistence.","time":{"start":1794383246113,"end":1794383246127}}}
